               <title>HOW SUPPLIED</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Clindamycin Phosphate Topical Lotion, 1% containing clindamycin phosphate equivalent to 10 mg clindamycin per milliliter is available in the following size:</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">60 mL</content> plastic squeeze bottle – NDC 21922-036-01</paragraph>
               </text>
